                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mala Yesu abotookhelela ne khukeniia mu ngoba chimboofu ne birekere, ne ekisia mu masinakooki ne khukhwilwacha Elomo Endayi eye bubwami bwe mwikulu, ne khuonia bulwaale bwoosi, ne butekhele bwoosi. ",
          "type": "text",
